OL,3,GNEWSALaura Anne Jones elected Reform's
OL,4,Adeputy Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform MS Laura Anne Jones has been
OL,7,Felected the party's deputy leader in
OL,8,FWales, the party has announced.
OL,10,FThe post was vacated after the previous
OL,11,Fdeputy Helen Jenner took the party's
OL,12,FSenedd leadership on Tuesday. A vote
OL,13,Fwas held among Reform's Senedd members.
OL,15,FIn a statement, Jones said: "We've made
OL,16,Fa fantastic start here in the Senedd,
OL,17,Fgiving a voice to the voiceless and
OL,18,Fstanding up for Wales' left-behind
OL,19,Fcommunities. I'm excited to work with
OL,20,FHelen Jenner and the rest of our team
OL,21,Fto deliver the real change Wales
OL,22,Fneeds."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
