OL,3,GNEWSALaura Anne Jones elected Reform's
OL,4,Adeputy Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FJones was suspended from the Senedd in
OL,7,FNovember 2025 after she used a racial
OL,8,Fslur to describe Chinese people in a
OL,9,FWhatsapp chat.
